      "widgets_values": [
        "Single uninterrupted cinematic dance shot in a black studio, same adult East Asian woman with short black bob, matte burgundy coat, black trousers and black boots. Restrained cool cyan shadows, neutral skin, moving soft light streaks behind the dancer, fine film texture. Coherent human anatomy, grounded feet, stable face, no extra limbs, no cuts, no captions, no graphic overlays. Dance phrase at approximately 100 beats per minute, sharp accents with controlled pauses. White sculptures stay rigid. Frontal full body. The lead dancer performs two grounded side steps, a crisp shoulder isolation, then both arms sweep down into a strong angular open stance. Two background dancers in sculptural grey costumes echo the arm gesture with a small delay, stay behind her and apart. Camera slowly pushes in. White classical torso sculptures and a small moss island at the edges remain still. Coat moves naturally. No jumping or complex spins.",
